# Command-line options bat should use by default; `bat --help` lists them all.

# gruvbox-dark is one of bat's built-in themes, so nothing has to be compiled
# into a cache for it: `bat --list-themes` shows what else is on offer.
--theme="gruvbox-dark"

# Italics are off because tmux does not pass them through by default.
#--italic-text=always

# Map a filename pattern to a language, e.g.
#--map-syntax ".ignore:Git Ignore"
